<title>DENMARK: Danish May current account surplus 0.3 bln DKK.</title>
<headline>Danish May current account surplus 0.3 bln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's current account surplus was 0.3 billion crowns in May 1997 the national statistics office said on Wednesday.</p>
